WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:02,090
What's wrong with gasoline?

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,490
Do you still have the ones you packed in your bag before? Is this enough?

3
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:08,290
We can at least have two more bottles each

4
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:10,090
Could you two please go outside to get some gas and come back?

5
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:16,920
It's better to bring more people with you. I know Lin Hao is there.

6
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:21,920
He found a few Bluetooth speakers over there and is currently researching Bluetooth speakers.

7
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:25,120
It’s a device that can play sounds remotely, Lin Hao said.

8
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,120
This is more subtle than using a drone to lure away the style

9
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,520
Drones are easy to spot

10
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:31,120
The speaker can be hidden in a distance and can be remotely controlled to produce sound.

11
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:34,120
Is the mobile phone charged? Where is the power bank? Yaping

12
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:36,920
Can you help me empty all the wine out of these bottles?

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:45,980
I'll go find you and explain that Qingshui has something to do with me.

14
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,380
Yaping helps Lin Hao at Xiaolin's place

15
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:49,580
Can you find a way to check it?

16
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:50,980
You will pass by it all the way from here to Jiangcheng

17
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:52,780
Maps of all locations, the more detailed the better

18
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,180
I'm going to plan a route

19
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:56,180
Try your best to avoid more dangerous places
